      "m": "11. 13. PM 03:02",
      "ts": 1794582168000,
      "fullText": "EXCLUSIVE Technology Startups EXCLUSIVE Musk Bets Push Antonio Gracias’s Valor to Eye-Popping Returns Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Expand Antonio Gracias Photographer: Eva Marie Uzcategui/Bloomberg Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Gift this article Contact us: Provide news feedback or report an error Confidential tip? Send a tip to our reporters Site feedback: Take our Survey New Window Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift By Carmen Arroyo November 13, 2026 at 3:02 PM UTC Bookmark Save Takeaways by Bloomberg AI Valor Equity Partners founder Antonio Gracias has cashed in on the decades of bets he’s placed on his close friend Elon Musk ’s companies: since 2003, Valor has delivered a 78% net return rate across all of its funds. The number over those 23 years — which is the annualized rate of return on invested capital accounting for the timing — is eye-popping. For comparison, a similar benchmark for US venture capital funds over a 20-year horizon stands at close to 14%."
